Models
  - models/kws/sherpa-onnx-kws-zipformer-gigaspeech-3.3M-2024-01-01 - a small keyword-spotting model made with icefall and
    converted for sherpa-onnx by its authors; its own README (included in that folder) declares "Apache License 2.0".
    It is the "hey Eya" wake-word model. Source: https://www.modelscope.cn/pkufool/sherpa-onnx-kws-zipformer-gigaspeech-3.3M-2024-01-01
  - onnx-community/whisper-tiny.en (OpenAI Whisper, MIT) - the on-device speech-recognition model. It is NOT stored in this
    repository: `npm run fetch-models` downloads it from Hugging Face and checks it against scripts/models.lock.json.
  - Kokoro-82M (Apache-2.0) - the optional offline voice, downloaded by the app on first use through kokoro-js.

